title: "NB Books Mobile"
abstract: >-
  Mobile companion of NB Books: read, annotate and study the books you choose from your PC library over the local
  network, with the same reading engine as the desktop, and control the PC reader from the phone. No account, no
  cloud and no telemetry.
type: software
